        "title": "Equivalent fractions",
        "text": "Here we write the right hand side as $$\\frac{2}{1}$$ and get \\n $$\\frac{x-1}{x+1}=\\frac{2}{1}$$ \\n if and only if $$x-1=2\\left(x+1\\right)$$.",
